# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately TRACKED, despite being generated: they are what makes the
# documented quick demonstration runnable without a 45-minute rebuild.
#   data/flash_dataset.npz        (6.4 MB)  the dataset, split indices included
#   results/checkpoints/*.pt      (6 x 140 kB)  the six reported models
#   results/metrics/*.json        the numbers quoted in README.md
#   results/figures/*.png         the figures quoted in README.md
#   logs/*.log                    the run records behind those numbers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
